<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16443" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ēvānĭdus</span></b> , a,
			um, adj.
		evanesco, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>vanishing</i>, <i>passing away</i>
			(not ante-Aug., and very rare). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pectora,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					5, 435</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">oleae,</span>”
				i. e. <i>frail</i>, <i>without strength</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Col. Arb. 17, 3</span></i>
			; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">arbores,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vitr.
					2, 10</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">materia vetustate,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 2,
				8</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">evanida et siticulosa calx,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 7,
				2</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">and, viriditas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					37, 5, 18, § 70</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">amor,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. R. Am. 653</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">gaudium (with leve),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen.
					Ep. 35</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
